1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:03,181
Brrr! Who has the warmest coat?

2
00:00:03,431 --> 00:00:04,585
Point to it!

3
00:00:07,885 --> 00:00:10,876
Baa! I have thick, fluffy wool.

4
00:00:11,126 --> 00:00:13,503
It's like a blanket!

5
00:00:14,053 --> 00:00:14,959
Pat, pat.

6
00:00:14,959 --> 00:00:16,015
So squishy!

7
00:00:17,865 --> 00:00:19,463
Quack! I have soft,

8
00:00:19,463 --> 00:00:22,442
fluffy feathers under my top feathers!

9
00:00:24,292 --> 00:00:25,292
Tweet, tweet!

10
00:00:25,592 --> 00:00:26,975
And the birds puff

11
00:00:26,975 --> 00:00:28,095
up into round,

12
00:00:28,095 --> 00:00:29,150
fluffy balls!

13
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,111
And your fur is your coat,

14
00:00:33,111 --> 00:00:33,621
Pip!

15
00:00:33,871 --> 00:00:35,910
Plus a red hat.

16
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:38,883
So who has the warmest coat?

17
00:00:39,133 --> 00:00:39,979
Guess!

18
00:00:43,279 --> 00:00:45,702
All of us, snuggled together!

19
00:00:45,952 --> 00:00:47,510
Big warm hug!

20
00:00:48,010 --> 00:00:49,714
Share with a friend and

21
00:00:49,714 --> 00:00:51,877
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

22
00:00:52,377 --> 00:00:53,983
Watch the full story

23
00:00:53,983 --> 00:00:55,589
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
